  "text": "A classic breakfast omelette is a lovely way to show your love for your mom. Here are the steps:\n\n1. Gather your ingredients: eggs, milk, salt, pepper, and any fillings you like (like cheese, vegetables, or ham).\n2. Crack the eggs into a bowl, add a splash of milk, salt, and pepper, and stir until well mixed.\n3. Heat a non-stick pan over medium heat and add a small amount of butter or oil.\n4. Pour the egg mixture into the pan and let it cook until the edges are set.\n5. Use a spatula to gently lift the edges and pour any uncooked mixture back into the center.\n6. Once the omelette is cooked through, place it on a plate.\n7. Add your chosen fillings and fold the omelette in half.\n8. Serve the omelette with a side of toast and coffee.\n\nEnjoy your breakfast together!",
